<title>USA: Odwalla expands juice recall.</title>
<headline>Odwalla expands juice recall.</headline>
<dateline>HALF MOON BAY, Calif. 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Odwalla Inc Chief Executive Officer Stephen Williamson said Thursday the company was expanding a juice recall triggered by an outbreak of bacterial sickness in the Seattle area.</p>
<p>Williamson said at a news conference that the company was recalling its carrot juice, organic carrot juice and vegetable cocktail drinks.</p>
<p>On Wednesday the company recalled its apple juice and all drinks containing apple juice after Odwalla apple juice was implicated in an outbreak of the E. coli bacteria that has sickened 13 people.</p>
</text>
